# AI Prompts
> مقتطفات جاهزة للنسخ. استبدل `@...` بالقيمة المطلوبة.

---

## Workflow

### 1. Report Cleanup
Follow the skill report-cleanup located within .opencode.
Clean up report: @report-name.md

### 2. Generate Plan
Follow the skill plan-generator located within .opencode.
Create plans for: @report-name.md

### 3. Execute Plan
Follow the skill plan-executor located within .opencode.
Implement plan: @plan-number-or-path.md

### 4. Review Plan
Follow the skill plan-reviewer located within .opencode.
Review plan: @plan-number-or-path.md

### 5. Commit Changes
Follow the skill commit-message located within .opencode.
Commit all changes.

---

## Advisory

### Tech Advisor
Follow the skill tech-advisor located within .opencode.
Review this and recommend: @question-or-file.md

### PM Advisor
Follow the skill pm-advisor located within .opencode.
Advise on: @question

---

## Bug Tracking

### Bug Report Formatter
Follow the skill bug-report-formatter located within .opencode.
Save this bug to docs/bugs/: @error-text

### Bug Resolver
Follow the skill bug-resolver located within .opencode.
Investigate and fix: @bug-id-or-path.md

---

## Reports

### Daily Report
Follow the skill daily-report located within .opencode.
Generate a daily report from: @file-name(s).md

---

## Audit

### Query Reviewer
Follow the skill query-reviewer located within .opencode.
Review queries in: @path-or-feature

### i18n Extractor
Follow the skill i18n-extractor located within .opencode.
Find hardcoded strings in: @path-or-scope

### Test Case Generator
Follow the skill test-case-generator located within .opencode.
Generate tests for: @class-or-method

### Flow Reviewer
Follow the skill flow-reviewer located within .opencode.
Explain the flow: @scenario

### Launch Checklist
Follow the skill launch-checklist located within .opencode.
Generate a launch checklist for: @feature-or-scope
